sidewalls: Birch Internal, UHMW Sintered Sidewalls (ultra-high molecular weight polyethylene, exceptional impact resistance, superior resilience, smooth damped ride)
base: Eco Sublimated TNT Base (fastest, highest-density UHMW base, dual-layer thermal fusion crystalline structure for consistent speed, titanium layer reflects heat, eco-friendly sublimation, performs without wax, easy to maintain and repair)
edge technology: Magne-Traction (seven strategically placed serrations along edges grip snow and hold strong edge in any condition)
